a làm việc của Yamada. Chán nản, anh quyết định đi tìm khu vực hút thuốc nhưng lại không tìm thấy. Ngay khi anh chuẩn bị rời đi, một cô gái mặc áo khoác da kiểu biker tên là Tayama rủ anh đến một khu vực hút thuốc bí mật!</p>","tmdb":{"id":"296286","type":"tv","season":1,"vote_average":9,"vote_count":13},"modified":"2026-07-24T15:31:44.000Z","cast":["Takuya Sato","Seena Hoshiki","Toa Yukinari","Megumi Toyoguchi","Rikuya Yasuda","Yoko Hikasa","Shinya Takahashi"],"director":[],"cast_meta":[{"name":"Takuya Sato","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Takuya Sato","tmdb_id":1253431,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZgoTs6DOSneHkoOWL751pQzLru.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1253431"},{"name":"Seena Hoshiki","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Seena Hoshiki","tmdb_id":3824816,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ajo0KjBdtYPH6FLjxeexHEStk3T.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/3824816"},{"name":"Toa Yukinari","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Toa Yukinari","tmdb_id":1139912,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aR11JLaHVeTM1RgGULsU9zIiaZs.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1139912"},{"name":"Megumi Toyoguchi","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Megumi Toyoguchi","tmdb_id":9710,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrnzkvoaODEplqhtkcyDgUa3Qtp.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/9710"},{"name":"Rikuya Yasuda","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Rikuya Yasuda","tmdb_id":2369259,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZCxGqkEibJkUEhLO9Xp4zNDlY3.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/2369259"},{"name":"Yoko Hikasa","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Yoko Hikasa","tmdb_id":1072774,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mP3bj0s1gqJ6tCKFLhu4b1CkJj7.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1072774"},{"name":"Shinya Takahashi","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Shinya Takahashi","tmdb_id":1157642,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19DN4yrD9c3E7BWthVEqvwhQNdb.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://